  esc esc  Edit last message

  Session
  tab     Send message
  ⌥+,     Less reasoning
  ⌥+.     More reasoning
  f4      Inspect activity
  ctrl+c  Quit

  Transcript (open first)
  ctrl+t                 Open transcript
  f3                     Find text
